":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：外观检查\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 某些物品会被标记为可使用放大镜检查。\\n在可检查的物品上使用放大镜即可打开检查托盘。\\n如果物品存在问题，你可以在检查托盘界面底部选择一个原因，并就此与顾客对质。\\n<b>如果物品是假冒的，指出一个问题就足以与顾客对质。<\/b>\\n\\n若指控属实，顾客将会调整价格。如果发生误判，你将失去声望，且顾客可能会去别处做生意。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":24,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":2,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":2,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：展示柜\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":102,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_